{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01V7RfYaFgwLEYPxsCxCePYP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FLYvntGHWCh3DDjg3ekjgd","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"irt_equated_bench_regen","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5996,"cache_read_input_tokens":16782,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5996,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":68,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01HkJqACspoJ5NeaQVjg5rfm","session_id":"f077ac60-b5f3-45fc-82ab-a50de5ad3465","uuid":"2b2aa7a6-7792-4bd9-87da-f20a796d6173"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FLYvntGHWCh3DDjg3ekjgd","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"## MVP 验证关键经验 (2026-05-20)\\\\n\\\\n### D001 决策：ETS C 分类 > p-value 检验\\\\n- **p-value based DIF 检测在 200-item benchmark 上严重 underpowered**：BH 校正后 TPR 仅 0.04-0.07（N=50, δ=1.0）\\\\n- **ETS C 分类（|Δ_MH|≥1.5 + 显著性）是可行的替代**：TPR=0.68-0.85 at N≥80, δ≥1.4\\\\n- **AUC 一直很好（0.91-0.96）**\\\\n\\\\n### 关键操作参数\\\\n- N≥80/group 最低要求，N≥100 显著改善\\\\n- δ≥1.4 logits 可靠检测区间\\\\n- MH 5 层 quantile + ETS C 阈值是最佳组合\\\\n- Subject ≥200 items 才有足够 matching precision（<100 items baseline FPR 膨胀至 ~56%）\\\\n\\\\n## D006: plan_011 Semi-Synthetic 验证成功 ✅\\\\n\\\\n### DIF 检测差异性污染有效\\\\n- **External MH**: temporal ΔTPR=+0.674 (0.326→1.000), FPR 恒定 0.314\\\\n- **Matching variable contamination**: 20% items 注入时 standard MH FPR 0.298→0.616, anchor/external 免疫\\\\n- **Li et al. enrichment≈1.0 原因**: web-overlap = 全局性污染，不产生 DIF\\\\n\\\\n## D007-D010: 降低 FPR 路线全部穷尽 ⚠️\\\\n\\\\n### plan_012 θ-Conditioning 失败\\\\n- logit θ 与 total score 相关性 0.9986 → 单维 θ 分层 ≡ 总分分层\\\\n\\\\n### plan_014 Within-Subject 前置检查：C% = 38.1% (>25%)\\\\n- 5 个高 C% subjects 的 within-subject temporal C% 均 >25%（31-45%）\\\\n- Within vs cross-subject matching 差异仅 -2.4pp → 信号对 matching 不敏感\\\\n- **结论**：temporal DIF 渗透到每个 subject 内部，不是 between-subject 能力差异的伪影\\\\n- Bifactor 方向因此否定（D010）\\\\n\\\\n### plan_013 Q3 局部独立性：温和但存在\\\\n- Within-subject mean Q3 = 0.009（低于 0.20 阈值）\\\\n- 但 11.3% within-subject pairs |Q3|>0.20（vs 2.2% cross-subject，5x）\\\\n- 最严重: moral_scenarios 34.2%, world_religions 18%, marketing 17.5%\\\\n- 不太可能单独解释 31% FPR\\\\n\\\\n### plan_016 Within-Subject Semi-Synthetic：DIF 在 subject 内也有效 ✅\\\\n- Cross-subject matching FPR 完全稳定（ΔFPR=0.000），4/5 subjects ΔTPR>0.3\\\\n- Within-subject matching FPR 膨胀 +0.067 to +0.281（matching variable 包含注入 items）\\\\n- **结论**：within-subject 38% C% 是真实 temporal DIF，方法论有效\\\\n\\\\n### 综合推导：31% temporal FPR 不是 artifact\\\\n证伪链完整：1D θ 无效 → within-subject 仍高 → bifactor 否定 → Q3 不是主因 → **这是 genuine temporal DIF**（2023→2024 模型在特定 items 上的真实差异性表现变化）。DIF 方法有效但无法区分 contamination-DIF 和 capability-DIF。\\\\n\\\\n## D012: plan_017 Downstream Impact — DIF Items ≠ 噪声 ⚠️\\\\n\\\\n### Hypothesis 被证伪但发现更有价值\\\\n- **假设**: 移除 DIF items → 排名更稳定 → DIF 标记了 problematic items\\\\n- **实际**: DIF 移除造成 **更大** 排名扰动（z = -8 to -49σ, 21/21 条件）\\\\n- DIF items 是浓缩的差异化信息载体，不是噪声\\\\n\\\\n### 关键数字\\\\n- Full vs stable-only: ρ = 0.996-0.999（排名本身极鲁棒）\\\\n- DIF items 跨代准确率变化 = full benchmark 的 1.09×, stable = 0.96×\\\\n- Top beneficiaries: phi-3, llama-3 衍生（+700-850 rank positions）\\\\n- Top hurt: mistral merge/slerp 模型（-400 to -587 rank positions）\\\\n\\\\n### 对论文的启示\\\\n- DIF items 不是\\\\\\\"要清洗的坏题\\\\\\\"——是\\\\\\\"揭示模型代际差异的诊断工具\\\\\\\"\\\\n- 支持 characterization narrative > cleaning narrative\\\\n- \\\\\\\"Stable-only benchmark\\\\\\\" 不是\\\\\\\"更好的 benchmark\\\\\\\"，而是\\\\\\\"不同视角的 benchmark\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n## plan_004: GSM8K Cross-Benchmark Validation (2026-05-21) 🔑\\\\n\\\\n### Step 1: GSM8K Temporal DIF 跨 benchmark 泛化 ✅\\\\n- GSM8K standard C% = 18.9%（MMLU 31.3%，同一量级）\\\\n- Sanity check 0.3%（通过）\\\\n- External matching C% = 47.4%——**非 contamination absorption**，是 construct validity gap（external benchmarks 测不同能力，控制了这些能力后 GSM8K item 行为差异更大）\\\\n- Standard vs external Spearman ρ = 0.926（高度一致）\\\\n\\\\n### Step 2: GSM8K Semi-Synthetic 验证 ✅\\\\n- Standard ΔTPR = +0.818 at p=1.0（MMLU +0.508，GSM8K 更强）\\\\n- External ΔTPR = +0.517\\\\n- GSM8K 的 DIF 对差异性污染更敏感（单域 benchmark, items 更同质）\\\\n\\\\n### Step 3: GSM1K Contamination Gap × DIF Correlation — 方向反转 ❌→🔑\\\\n- **r = −0.478 (p=0.005)**：contaminated 模型在 DIF-C items 上更差，非更好\\\\n- Partial r = −0.385 控制整体准确率后仍显著\\\\n- Permutation p = 0.014，robust to leave-one-out\\\\n- 171/249 DIF-C items α_MH < 1 → favor focal (2024) models（捕获真实代际能力提升）\\\\n- 78/249 DIF-C items α_MH > 1 → favor reference (2023) models\\\\n\\\\n### Step 3 核心洞察\\\\n- **DIF ⊥ contamination**：DIF 捕捉的 measurement anomalies 与 contamination 正交\\\\n- 171 个 focal-favoring DIF-C items 捕获真实代际能力提升，但 contaminated 模型在这些 items 上反而更差（r=−0.347, p=0.048）——contamination 的\\\\\\\"浅层\\\\\\\"boost 无法泛化到区分真实能力的题目\\\\n- **这是 characterization narrative 的强 evidence**：DIF 不标记\\\\\\\"被污染的 items\\\\\\\"，标记的是\\\\\\\"不同模型代际间行为模式不一致的 items\\\\\\\"\\\\n- 与 Xu et al. (2024) GSM1K 互补——他们检测 contamination，我们检测 construct-level measurement anomalies\\\\n\\\\n### α_MH 方向约定（Reviewer 修正 2026-05-21）\\\\n- α_MH > 1 → item 对 reference group 更容易\\\\n- α_MH < 1 → item 对 focal group 更容易\\\\n- 在 temporal cohort 中：reference = 2023, focal = 2024\\\\n\\\\n## 数据源 (2026-05-20)\\\\n\\\\n### METABENCH (Kipnis et al., ICLR 2025) ⭐\\\\n- GitHub: https://github.com/adkipnis/metabench\\\\n- Zenodo: https://zenodo.org/records/12819251 (620MB)\\\\n- MMLU 12,508 items, 5,219 模型\\\\n\\\\n### D002: preproc.rds diff/disc 是 CTT 不是 IRT\\\\n- diff = 0.75 × p_correct, disc = rpbis\\\\n- 实际 IRT 在 crossvalidate.R 用 mirt::mirt() slope-intercept\\\\n\\\\n### Li et al. (EMNLP 2024) Proxy Ground Truth\\\\n- 9,229/12,508 items 有标注（73.8%）\\\\n- clean 60.5% / input_and_label 33.0% / input_only 6.5%\\\\n- Web overlap proxy，非训练数据精确标签——全局性污染，不适合 DIF 验证\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4457, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01HkJqACspoJ5NeaQVjg5rfm","session_id":"f077ac60-b5f3-45fc-82ab-a50de5ad3465","uuid":"4912b8d3-9e57-48cb-b300-4c63ca7484b5","timestamp":"2026-05-21T02:17:31.833Z"}
